# Primary-source and priority record

**Audit date:** 28 September 2026. Sources were searched or independently reopened and checked during this audit. Supplied ledgers were treated as leads, not certifications. Full-text inspection means the relevant definitions/theorem passages were read; it does not mean every proof in the source was independently refereed. URLs below are stable source locators, not local copies. No copyrighted full papers are redistributed in this package.

## S1 - Marginal/Fourier equivalence

Boaz Barak, Kamalika Chaudhuri, Cynthia Dwork, Satyen Kale, Frank McSherry, Kunal Talwar. *Privacy, Accuracy, and Consistency Too: A Holistic Solution to Contingency Table Release*. PODS 2007, pp. 273-282. DOI `10.1145/1265530.1265569`.

Primary full text: `https://www.boazbarak.org/Papers/privacy.pdf`

**Checked:** relevant full-text section, Theorem 5 and equation (11), including a rendered PDF page; the subsequent count of low-order Fourier coordinates. **Bearing:** explicit antecedent for Q1/Q3/Q5. The differential-privacy application is not being imported; the exact algebraic equivalence applies before noise is introduced.

## S2 - Minimum Boolean collisions as trades

E. Ghorbani, S. Kamali, G. B. Khosrovshahi, D. S. Krotov. *On the Volumes and Affine Types of Trades*. Electronic Journal of Combinatorics 27(1), P1.29, 2020. DOI `10.37236/8367`; arXiv `1810.02296`.

Primary text: `https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.02296`

**Checked:** full-PDF trade definition, minimum-volume statement (Lemma 4 in the inspected version), and context. **Bearing:** a nonempty [k]-trade has minimum volume 2^k in each leg; the associated Boolean disagreement is 2^(k+1). The report independently reconstructs the polynomial-support proof instead of asserting novelty for this bound.

## S3 - Generalized Chow parameters

Ilias Diakonikolas and Daniel M. Kane. *Degree-d Chow Parameters Robustly Determine Degree-d PTFs (and Algorithmic Applications)*. STOC 2019. DOI `10.1145/3313276.3316301`; arXiv `1811.03491`.

Primary text: `https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.03491`

**Checked:** full-PDF introductory uniqueness statement and attribution, as well as abstract. **Bearing:** established exact uniqueness underlying Q11; the paper develops a stronger robust theory. The simple exact uniqueness proof in this audit is a reconstruction, not a new theorem.

## S4 - Earlier threshold-function antecedent

