## S5 - 2026 random-function reconstruction

Yiming Chen. *Low-Degree Fourier Threshold for Random Boolean Functions*. arXiv `2604.13493`, 2026; version 2 was inspected.

Primary text: `https://arxiv.org/html/2604.13493v2`

**Checked:** full HTML theorem statements, assumptions, and proof discussion relevant to the threshold. **Bearing:** a current preprint on typical Boolean-function reconstruction around n/2, with a square-root-logarithmic window. It does not replace worst-case parity arguments or establish this project's rank-class corollary. It is cited as a preprint, not certified here as a peer-reviewed theorem.

