Primary HTML: `https://arxiv.org/html/2502.03702v1`

**Checked:** definitions, main comparison theorem, and operation discussion in full text; publisher metadata. **Bearing:** direct prior art for a tensor representation/KC comparison. The inspected model uses ordered tensor trains with bounded-entry integer cores and ordinary arithmetic, not unrestricted-precision real cores or GF(2) cores. Variable order and algebra must remain explicit in comparisons.

