## Search record and stopping rule

Queries included combinations of marginal/subcube sums, Walsh/Fourier reconstruction, binary row/column marginals, GF(2) rank, parity, design trades, Chow parameters, knowledge compilation, OBDDs, tensor trains, Boolean decomposition and exact model counting. Targeted literal queries included:

```
